xt"},{"text":"Router","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Router","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/router","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/Router","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Manages programmatic navigation for both stack-based and split-view contexts."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftRouting/documentation/SwiftRouting/RouterModel":{"fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RouterModel","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swiftrouting\/routermodel","role":"symbol","title":"RouterModel","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"RouterModel","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Defines navigation capabilities within a ","type":"text"},{"code":"ViewModel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or other components.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftRouting\/documentation\/SwiftRouting\/RouterModel","kind":"symbol"}}}